# Shared Settings drawer (G9, 2026-10-04). Before this the title-bar gear opened
# an empty drawer on TBC. Every section self-gates on the modules this build
# registered, so TBC gets Quest Automation (AutoQuest/AutoEquip/VendorAssist),
# Module Health, module switches, Export/Import and About -- nothing retail-only.
Modules\Infrastructure\Settings.lua

