# Bindings.xml is deliberately NOT listed here. WoW loads an addon's
# Bindings.xml automatically from the addon root; listing it makes the client
# parse it a second time as ordinary UI XML, which errors. See ToonAge.toc.

# In-game self-test: /ta test, /tatest, or the Self-test title-bar button. Loads last.
# Not a registered module (not profile-gated): it only runs when invoked, so
# every client can run the launch checklist's self-test step.
Modules\Infrastructure\TestHarness.lua
